=== diagnostics configuration is collected by a probe, not by phase A ===
  ok   phase A never reads the configuration and says the probe is pending
  ok   a report from the Debug menu completes the configuration after phase A
  ok   the probe answers on a timer, alone, with both sections
  ok   a slow reader past the deadline is a timeout that publishes no section
  ok   a reader that raises is an error state, never an empty success
  ok   without an asynchronous scheduler the state is unsupported, never a blocking fallback
  ok   cancelling the run before the timer publishes nothing
